# Requirements

## Functional Requirements
- Enforce energy flow consistency
- Model subsystem behavior with physics-informed equations
- Simulate flight phases
- Support configurable mission profiles
- Support configurable aircraft parameters
- Support subsystem scaling
- Support multiple hybridization modes
- Provide a graphical user interface
- Provide output visualization

## Non-Functional Requirements
- Numerical stability under normal simulation step sizes
- Runtime suitable for standard laptops
- Compatibility with MATLAB/Simulink
- No dependency on specialized external toolboxes
- Validation against a trusted reference toolbox
